# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  Tom Chen — Project Hub
#  最上面這段是機密檔案，改動前請務必確認，這是防止金鑰外流的第一道防線。
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── 環境變數與金鑰（絕對不能進版控） ──────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.sample

# AI_agent 的 config.json 內含 Gemini / Anthropic API 金鑰
projects/web/AI_agent/config.json

*.key
*.pem
*.pfx
*.p12
credentials*.json
secrets*.json
service-account*.json
token.json

# ── 資料庫（含實際營運資料與個資，只留在本機） ────────────────
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite-shm
*.sqlite-wal
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

# ── Python ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.venv/
venv/
ENV/
env/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ── 打包產物（可由原始碼重新產生，體積動輒數 GB） ──────────────
build/
dist/
*.manifest

# ── Node ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
.next/
npm-debug.log*

# ── Hub 執行記錄 ──────────────────────────────────────────────
hub/logs/
*.log

# ── 備份、暫存與中間產物 ──────────────────────────────────────
*-backup-*
*.bak
*.tmp
*.temp
~$*
err.log
build_err.txt
build_log.txt

# ── 錄音與匯出成品（AI 會議助理會產生大量檔案） ────────────────
projects/desktop/AI_Meeting_Assistant/audio/*
!projects/desktop/AI_Meeting_Assistant/audio/.gitkeep
projects/desktop/AI_Meeting_Assistant/reports/*
!projects/desktop/AI_Meeting_Assistant/reports/.gitkeep
projects/desktop/AI_Meeting_Assistant/export/*.docx
projects/desktop/AI_Meeting_Assistant/export/*.pdf

# ── 上傳檔案 ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
projects/desktop/LLM_QA_Professional/uploads/*
!projects/desktop/LLM_QA_Professional/uploads/.gitkeep

# ── 編輯器與作業系統 ──────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
